INTENDED USE

RAGStrike is an offensive security evaluation tool. It is intended for use
against systems you own or have written authorisation to test. By default it
accepts only local targets (127.0.0.1, localhost) and requires a persisted
authorisation record before any scan runs. See SECURITY.md.
